            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colour libraries"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fargebiblioteker: .ase (Adobe Swatch Exchange), .aco (Photoshop-fargeprøver) og .acb (Adobe Color Book) – fargekart med navngitte toner, som RAL, NCS, malingsprodusentenes kart eller Freetone. Kolorist leverer ingen slike kart; du importerer dine egne.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colour libraries: .ase (Adobe Swatch Exchange), .aco (Photoshop swatches) and .acb (Adobe Color Book) – colour charts with named tones, such as RAL, NCS, paint manufacturers’ charts or Freetone. Kolorist ships no such charts; you import your own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
