    "LCH": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LCH"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LRV bakgrunn": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LRV background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LRV er CIE-luminansen Y i prosent – andelen synlig lys en flate reflekterer, slik malingsprodusentene oppgir den. Kolorist regner den for fargen slik den vises i sRGB. Kontrast mellom flater oppgis som forskjell i LRV-poeng (BS 8300: minst 30) og som luminanskontrast (Y₁ − Y₂)/(Y₁ + Y₂) etter NS 11001 (0,4 for viktige flater, 0,8 for skilt). «Rett opp» endrer bare lysheten i OKLCH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LRV is the CIE luminance Y in per cent – the share of visible light a surface reflects, as paint manufacturers state it. Kolorist computes it for the colour as shown in sRGB. Contrast between surfaces is given as a difference in LRV points (BS 8300: at least 30) and as luminance contrast (Y₁ − Y₂)/(Y₁ + Y₂) per NS 11001 (0.4 for important surfaces, 0.8 for signage). “Fix” changes only lightness in OKLCH."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LRV flate": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LRV surface"
          }
        }
      }
    },
